\item[S2] M. Kida, Problem 21.68, in E. I. Khukhro and V. D. Mazurov (eds.), \emph{The Kourovka Notebook: Unsolved Problems in Group Theory}, 21st edition, arXiv:1401.0300v48 (6 October 2026). See also source definitions in Problems 19.51. This version records a refutation; the displayed question is the historically registered target. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1401.0300v48}.
